A compact line over the word cap that joins clauses: more than one fact on a line.
-- hit/agent-compact --
Prove drift by regenerating a second time, never by reading the diff and judging it; same diff again with inputs unchanged means environmental drift.
Merge conflicts settle with magus vcs resolve in one pass over every generated file, and only the conflicts it cannot settle remain for a person to merge.
-- pass/agent-compact --
Prove drift: regenerate second time, never read diff and judge.
Same diff again, inputs unchanged -> environmental.
